[0.002, "o", "\u001b[4;3H\u001b[93mNotable plaintext strings wor\u001b[Ch follow-up\u001b[39m                                                                     \r\n              \r\n\u001b[93m📌 #q-string-table —\u001b[CDecode the Base64+RC4 string table\u001b[Cinitialized at 0x140002b6c\u001b[36m\u001b[1m main\u001b(B\u001b[m                    \r\n\u001b[93mFunc\u001b[Cion ini\u001b[C_string_table_b64_rc4 @\u001b[C0x140002b6c (see #fn-140002b6c) appears\u001b[Cto build a table of obfuscated strings\r\ndecoded with Base64 the\u001b[C RC4 (19 detector\u001b[Cfindi\u001b[Cgs, including web-protocol strings).\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                                      \r\n\u001b[93mDetermin\u001b[C:\u001b[39m                                 \u001b[12;1H\u001b[93m- The RC4 key(s) and\u001b[Cthe exact decode pipeline\u001b[39m                                         \r\n\u001b[93m- Decode\u001b[CEVERY string in the table\u001b[Cand post the full plaintext list\u001b[39m                                                \r\n\u001b[93m- Where\u001b[Cthe decoded\u001b[Cstrings are stor\u001b[Cd (global addresses) so other analysts can map usages\u001b[16;1HThis l\u001b[Ck\u001b[Cly contains C2 endpoints, URLs, registry keys, file paths — the core config.\u001b[18;1H📌 #q-main-flow — Map the program's main \u001b[Cxecution flow and major components\u001b[36m\u001b[1m main\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93mTrace from the\u001b[Centry poin\u001b[C /\u001b[Cm\u001b[Cin through \u001b[Che program's top-level logic. Identify the major functional components\r\n(init, config deco\u001b[Ce, C2 loop, comman\u001b[2Cdispatch, worker threads, etc.) wi\u001b[Ch\u001b[Cfu\u001b[Cction addresses. Note where\r\ninit_string_table_b64_rc4 @ 0x140002b6c (#fn-140002b6c), the crypto ctor @ 0x140001e10 (#fn-140001e10), and self-delete\r\n@ 0x14003b870 (#fn-14003b870) fit in. Classify the program (lo\u001b[Cder\u001b[C/\u001b[Cbackd\u001b[Cor\u001b[C/ stealer / ran