[0.001, "o", "\u001b[4;1H\u001b[94m5.\u001b[93m\u001b[1m Single-instance gate (named EVENT, not mutex)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m: while (OpenEventW(0x1F0003 /*EVENT_ALL_ACCESS*/,\r\nname=ComputerName+UserN\u001b[Cme)) { CloseHandle; Sleep; } th\u001b[Cn Crea\u001b[2CEventW; ExitProcess(0) on failure.\u001b[39m                \r\n\u001b[94m6\u001b[C\u001b[93m\u001b[1m Build-expiry date kill-switch\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m: build_expiry_date_string_from_table @\u001b[1m 0x14002a4c0\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m (concatenates 4 decrypted\r\nstring-table entries into a date string) → stealc_main_operation @\u001b[1m 0x14002a774\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m, which parses it via\r\nparse_expiry\u001b[Cd\u001b[Cte\u001b[Cpct_d_m_Y @\u001b[1m 0x14002a298\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m using\u001b[Cformat \"%d/%m/%Y\"\u001b[C(day/month/year —\u001b[Cliteral confirmed\u001b[Cboth\u001b[Ci\u001b[2Cdecompile\r\nand by raw byte read: ASCII 25 64 2f 25 6d 2f 25 59 at file offset 0x80698) and compares mktime(expiry) < mktime(now).\r\nParse failure → ExitProcess(0).\r\n\u001b[94m7. \u001b[93mIf \u001b[1mnot expired\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m → stealc_orchestrator_collect_exfil_selfde\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
