[0.009, "o", "\u001b[4;1H\u001b[93m    - .data  0x8A000 0x3AFAC  0x88400 0x29400 (rw; virtual 0x3AFAC >> raw 0x29400 = large BSS, normal)\r\n    - .pdata 0xC5000 0x41F4   0xB1800 0x4200\r\n \u001b[C  - .reloc 0xCA00\u001b[C 0xCFC \u001b[C  0xB5A00 0xE00\u001b[39m                                 \u001b[7;3H\u001b[93mData directories: Import RVA\u001b[C0x88754; \u001b[Cxception; BaseReloc; Debug RVA 0x829F0;\u001b[1m TLS directory RVA 0x82C00\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m (check for\r\nTLS callbacks); Load Config RVA 0x828B0.\u001b[1m No resource section\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m (no version info/icon),\u001b[1m no certificate table\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m, no delay\r\nimports, no CLR.\u001b[39m                                                                                                    \r\n                                                                                            \r\n\u001b[93m💬 reply #q-\u001b[Criage\u001b[36m\u001b[1m ReverseEngineer(Europa)\r\n\u001b[93mAnomaly: file is truncated mid-.reloc; no overlay.\u001b(B\u001b[m                                                                 \r\n     \u001b[14;3H\u001b[93m.reloc declares raw data at 0xB5A00 + 0xE00\u001b[C= end 0xB6800, and the reloc directory size is 0xCFC (data should end at\r\n0xB66FC), but the file is only 7\u001b[C5472\u001b[C=\u001b[1m 0xB6000\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m bytes.\r\n-\u001b[CVerified by byte read: relocation entries run continuously right up to EOF (last block header 64 01 00 00 size field\r\nat\u001b[C0xB5F00;\u001b[Centries like 00 a8 end exactly at\u001b[C0xB5FFF). So\u001b[1m ~0x6FC bytes of real relocation data are missing\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m — the\r\ndistributed file was\u001b[Ccut, it\u001b[Cwas not built this way.\r\n-\u001b[CConsequen\u001b[Ce: zero overlay/appended data (negative overlay). The sample still loads and runs if not rebased; Ghidra\r\npads the missing tail with\u001b[Czeros.\u001b[39m                                                         