[0.001, "o", "\u001b[4;1H\u001b[93mPOSTs \u001b[Ceacon JSON, compares response opcode string against decrypted table entries, then iterates a task array\r\nswitching on task-type int:\u001b[39m          \r\n\u001b[93m    - \u001b[1m0\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m → task_downloa\u001b[C_and_shellexecute @ \u001b[1m0x140028978\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m (EXE; optional runas verb from flag at task+0x24).\r\n-\u001b[1m 1\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m → task_powershell_iex_downloadstring @\u001b[1m 0x140028e58\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m (ShellExecuteExA powershell with an iex(...DownloadString(...))\r\ncommand built from decrypted\u001b[Cstrings).\r\n-\u001b[1m 2\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m → task_download_msi_run_msi\u001b[Cxec_passive @\u001b[1m 0x140029224\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m (drop-dir enum 0–6 → CSIDL\u001b[10;4Hc/\u001b[Cx\u001b[Ca/\u001b[Cx10/\u001b[2C28/\u001b[Cx05/\u001b[Cx26/0x2a, random 12-char filename via gen_random_12char_name_mt19937,\r\nhttp_download_url_to_file @ 0x14000b1e0, then ShellExecuteExA msiexec /i \"<file>\" + decrypted switch, retried up to\r\n10×).\u001b[39m                                        \r\n                                     \r\n\u001b[93mCleanup:\u001b[39m                                            \r\n                                       \r\n\u001b[93m- self_delete_cmd_timeout_del_she\u001b[Clex\u001b[Ccute @\u001b[1m 0x14003b870\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m — flag-gated: GetModuleFileNameA → ShellExecuteExA\r\nC:\\Windows\\system32\\cm\u001b[C.exe /c tim\u001b[Cout /\u001b[C 5 & del /f /q \"<self>\" → ExitProcess(0).\r\n\u001b[39m   \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1mWorker threads: none.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m find_function *thread* returns only CRT locale/init-thread library functions; there is no\r\nCreateT\u001b[Cread/CreateRemoteThread-based worker. All stages run sequentially on the\u001b[Cmain thread; the\u001b[Conly con\u001b[Currency\r\nprimitive\u001b[Cis the QueueUserAPC early-bird\u001b[Cinjection into a suspended browser process.\u