[0.000, "o", "\u001b[4;1H                                                                                                              \r\n\u001b[93mCleanup:\u001b[39m                   \r\n                                                                                                         \u001b[7;2H\u001b[93m self_delete_cmd_timeout\u001b[2Cel_shellexecute @\u001b[1m 0x14003b\u001b[C70\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m — f\u001b[Cag-ga\u001b[2Cd: GetModul\u001b[CFileNameA → ShellExecuteExA\u001b[39m           \r\n\u001b[93mC:\\Wi\u001b[2Cows\\system32\\cmd.ex\u001b[C /c t\u001b[Cmeout /t 5 & del /f /q \"<self>\" → ExitProcess(0).\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                                    \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1mWorker threads: none.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m find_function\u001b[C*thread* retu\u001b[Cns only CRT locale/i\u001b[Cit-thread library functions; there is no\r\nCreateThread/CreateRemot\u001b[CThread-based worker.\u001b[CAll stages run sequ\u001b[Cntially on the main thread;\u001b[Cthe only concurrency\u001b[39m \r\n\u001b[93mprimitive is the QueueUserAPC early-bird injection into a suspended browser process.\u001b[1m Persistence: none\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m (consistent with\r\nthe non-resident design; self-delete instead).\r\n\u001b[39m        \r\n\u001b[97m🤖\u001b[36m\u001b[1m Developer(Sinope)\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97mStrong results: the full table is\u001b[1m 276 strings\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m at minlen 4 (matching the known-complete table), still zero persistence\r\nhits; the pure-Rhai RC4 route byte-matches the native decode; and the only \"timeout/del\" in the whole file is a\r\n\u001b[1mplaintext\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m literal\u001b[93m /c timeout /t 5 & del /f /q \"\u001b[97m at file 0x8191b (≈ VA 0x14008271b, .rdata) — the self-delete command,\r\noutside the encrypted table. Let me tie that literal to its consumer and (bonus for #q-string-table) recover the\r\nglobal-storage mapping with the proven\u001b[93m rc4_b64_strings\u001b[97m.\u001b[39m                                                           \r\n                                                                                                                       \r\n\u001b[90m○\u001b[39m \u001b[90mDeveloper(Sinope) · ▸ string_refs(timeout /t 5) · …running\u001b[24;60H\u001b[39m           \u001b[36m\u001b[1m⠙ \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[90mThinking…\u001b[39m \u001b[35m\u001b[1mD\u001b[Cveloper(Sinope)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[37m: calling s\u001b[Cring_r\u001b[Cfs\u001b[26;2H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
