[0.026, "o", "\u001b[4;1H                                                                                  \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1mWorker threads: none.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m find_function *thread* returns only CRT locale/init-thread library functions; there is no\r\nCreateThread/CreateRemoteThread-based worker. All stages run sequentially on the\u001b[Cmain thread; the only concurrency\r\np\u001b[Cimitive is th\u001b[C QueueUs\u001b[CrAPC early-bird injection into a susp\u001b[Cnd\u001b[Cd browser process.\u001b[1m Persistence: none\u001b[C\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m(consistent with\r\nthe non-resident\u001b[Cdesign; self-delete \u001b[Cnstead).\u001b[39m                                                                         \r\n                                              \r\n\u001b[97m🤖\u001b[36m\u001b[1m Developer(Sinope)\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97mStrong results: the full table is\u001b[1m 276 strings\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m at minlen 4 (matching the known-complete table), still zero persistence\r\nhits; th\u001b[C pure-Rhai\u001b[CRC4 route byte-matches the nat\u001b[Cve decode; and the only \"timeout/d\u001b[Cl\" in the who\u001b[Ce file is a\u001b[39m      \r\n\u001b[97m\u001b[1mplaintext\u001b[C\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97mlit\u001b[Cral\u001b[93m /c timeout /t 5 & del /f /q \"\u001b[97m \u001b[2C file 0x8191b (≈ VA\u001b[C0x14008271b, .rdata) — the se\u001b[Cf-de\u001b[2Cte command,\r\noutside the encrypted table. Let me tie that literal to\u001b[Cits consumer and (bonus for #q-string-tabl\u001b[C) recover\u001b[Cthe\u001b[39m     \r\n\u001b[97mglobal-s\u001b[Corage ma\u001b[Cping with th\u001b[C proven\u001b[93m rc4_b64_strings\u001b[97m.\u001b[39m                                                         \r\n                                                       \r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[C\u001b[90mDeveloper(Sinope) · ▸ string_refs(timeout /t 5) · 242 chars\r\n\u001b[39m \u001b[C                                                           \r\n\u001b[90m○\u0