[0.002, "o", "\u001b[4;1H\u001b[32m●\u001b[C\u001b[90mDeveloper(Sinope) · ▸ string_refs(timeout /t 5) · 242 chars\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                                                           \r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[39m \u001b[90mDeveloper(Sinope) · ▸ run_script(rc4_b64_strings) · 48511 chars\u001b[39m                 \u001b[8;1H\u001b[93m💬 reply #q-triage\u001b[36m\u001b[1m ReverseEngineer(Europa)\u001b(B\u001b[m                                                                     \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1mToolchain/language and entry→main chain:\u001b(B\u001b[m                                                                          \r\n                                                                                                                       \r\n\u001b[93m-\u001b[1m Toolchain:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m MSVC, l\u001b[Cnker 14.43 (\u001b[1mVisual Studio 2022\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m, v17.13 era), CRT\u001b[1m statically linked\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m (Rich header present; Ghidra\r\nFID-matched CRT library functions, e.g. __scr\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93mt_common_main_seh). Confirms #runtime-noise.\r\n-\u001b[1m Language: C++\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m — MSVC STL std::string with SSO is everywhere (the if (0xf < capacity) ptr = *ptr pattern in the\r\ndynamic-API resolver), bad_array_new_length ctor (#fn-140001e10), and an embedded\u001b[1m nlohmann/json\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m library (assert path\u001b[39m \r\n\u001b[93mstring C:\\builder_v2\\stealc\\json.h @ 0x14007f550 plus its full set of \"invalid string: control character U+00xx\"\r\nmessages).\u001b[39m                                                                                                           \r\n\u001b[93m- \u001b[1mEntry:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m entry @ \u001b[1m0x14003f864\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m → __security_init_cookie() + __scrt_common_main_seh @ 0x14003f6f0.\u001b[39m                 \r\n\u001b[93m-\u001b[1m Real main:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m __scrt_common_main_seh calls \u001b[C_scrt_get_\u001b[Chow_window_mode + _get_wide_winmain_command_line and then invokes\r\nmain as main(&IMAGE_DOS_HEADER_140000000, 0, wide_cmdline) — i.e. a\u001b[1m wWinMain\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m (GUI, matches subsystem 2) at\u001b[1m 0x14002a88c\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m,\r\nalready named stealc_main_cis_locale_and_single_instance_gate (size 554 bytes).\r\n- The builder path C:\\builder_v2\\stealc\\json.h is a direct\u001b[1m Stealc v2\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m tell (matches memory family-intel-stealc-v1-v2,\r\nwhich lists this exact builder-path indicator, 64-bit build, and base64+RC4 string table — cf. #fn-140002b6c).\u001b[24;62H\u001b[36m\u001b[1m⠦ \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[90mThinking…\u001b[39m \u001b[35m\u001b[1mReverseEngine\u001b[Cr(Eu\u001b[Copa)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[37m: calling create_commen\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
