[0.011, "o", "\u001b[4;1H\u001b[93m💬 reply #q-triage\u001b[36m\u001b[1m ReverseEngineer(Europa)\u001b(B\u001b[m                   \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1mImports/exports summary + runtime API resolution:\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[C                                                               \r\n\u001b[93m-\u001b[1m Imports: only 2 DLLs, 91 functions.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m KERNEL32.DLL ×90 — almost entirely CRT-support (heap, TLS/FLS, locale, critical\r\nsections, FindFirstFileExW/FindNextFileW, GetCommandLineW, WriteConsoleW, IsDebuggerPresent, QueryPerformanceCounter,\r\netc.) plus the loader primitives LoadLibraryA + GetProcAddress. WININET.DLL ×1: InternetSetOptionA\u001b[1m only\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m.\r\n-\u001b[1m Exports: none\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m (export directory is zeroed; Ghidra's \"entry\" @ 0x14003f864 is just the entry point symbol, not a real\r\nexport).\u001b[39m                                                                                                            \r\n\u001b[93m-\u001b[1m Runtime API resolution: YES, extensive.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m resolve_dy\u001b[Ca\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[C\u001b[93mic_apis_core_ke\u001b[Cnel32_advapi32 @\u001b[1m 0x14003c0a8\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m does\r\nLoadLibraryA(decrypted_name) → Ge\u001b[CProcAddress, w\u001b[Cth every DLL/API name held in a C++ std::string global that\u001b[Cis filled\r\nb\u001b[C the base64+RC4 string-table init @ 0x140002b6c (#q\u001b[Cstring-table). It bootstraps its own\u001b[39m                          \r\n\u001b[93mpfn_GetProcAddr\u001b[Css/pfn_LoadLibraryA and fills global pointer slots\u001b[C(DAT_1400b4d58, DAT_1400b4e10/e28/e30/e38/ea0,\r\nDAT_1400b4b38...).\u001b[17;3HPlaintext WinINet names sit in .rdata awaiting runtime resolu\u001b[Cion: I\u001b[CternetOpenW, InternetConnectW, HttpOpenRequestW,\r\nHttpSendRequestW, InternetRe\u001b[CdFil\u001b[C,\u001b[CInternetCloseHandle, InternetOpenUrlA — so the real HTTP c\u001b[Cpability is\u001b[Chidden from\u001b[39m \r\n\u001b[93mthe static import table (matches family-intel-st\u001b[Calc-v1-v2: Stealc v2 WinINet C2).\u001b[39m                                     \r\n\u001b[93m- "]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93mOther\u001b[CGetProcAddress callers (FUN_14003ef2c, FUN_140052640,\u001b[CFUN_140059e50, FUN_1400446fc (uint, LPCSTR, uint*,\r\nuint*)) are CRT \u001b[Cry_get_function-\u001b[2Cyle helpers, not\u001b[Cmalware logic.\u001b[39m                                                  \r\n\u001b[93m- Caution for who\u001b[Cver maps the slot\u001b[Ctable: see\u001b[Cmemory\u001b[Cpitfall-pipelined-getprocaddress-slot-stores.\u001b[39m           \u001b[26;2H"]
