[0.002, "o", "\u001b[4;1H\u001b[93mtargets are NOT hardcoded, server-supplied).\u001b[39m           \u001b[6;1H\u001b[93m\u001b[1m2. Loader-task fetch —\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m c2_beacon_and_dispatch_tasks\u001b[1m @ 0x140029900\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m: {\"type\":\"loader\", \"access_token\":\"<token>\"} →\r\nresponse {\"opcode\":\"success\", \"loader\":[ {url/arg string, ints, task_type int}, ... ]}. Dispatch on task_type:\r\n\u001b[39m \u001b[C                                                                                                                      \u001b[9;1H\u001b[93m- 0 → task_download_and_sh\u001b[Cllexecute (download EXE via http_download_url_to_f\u001b[Cle +\u001b[CShellExecute)\r\n- 1 → FUN_140028e58 (per Stealc V2 intel: MSI via msiexec)\u001b[11;3H2 → FUN_140029224 (per Stealc V2 intel: PowerShell IEX downloader) Contains the hard family tell: nlohmann assert\r\npath C:\\\u001b[Cuilder_v2\\stealc\\json.h. Called twice from stealc_orchestrator_collect_exfil_selfdelete @ 0x140029f68\u001b[39m         \r\n\u001b[93m(b\u001b[Cfore/after collection) — fetch\u001b[Cand-\u001b[Cxecute, no persistent polling loop (non-resident stealer).\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                                                                \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1m3. Exfil upload —\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m c2_upload_file_chunked_base64_json\u001b[1m @ 0x140009814\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m: splits file into\u001b[1m 0x40000-byte (256 KiB) chunks\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m,\u001b[39m    \u001b[16;2H\u001b[93mas\u001b[C64s each chunk, hand-assembles JSON: {\"access_token\":\"...\", \"data\":\"<b64 \u001b[Chunk>\", \"filename\":\"...\",\r\n\"type\":\"upload_file\", \"part_index\":N, \"total_parts\":M} (literals \"part_index\": / \"total_parts\": are plaintext in .rdata\r\n@ ~0x14007f5xx — these ar\u001b[C the\u001b[Cdetector Content-Type/URI hits at 0x14002a42e/0x14003a3d3 vicinity), then base64(JSON)\r\nPOST per chunk; checks opcode of each response.\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                                                                    \r\n\u001b[93mTraffic \"encryption\" = base64 e\u001b[Ccoding only; no\u001b[CTLS, no RC4 on \u001b[Che HTTP body (RC4 is only for the embedded string\u001b[39m \r\n\u001b[93mt\u001b[Cble). Matches memory\u001b[Cfamily-\u001b[Cntel-stealc-v1-v2 v2 traits.\u001b[2B\u001b[36m\u001b[1m⠙ \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[90mThink\u001b[2Cg…\u001b[39m \u001b[35m\u001b[1mRevers\u001b[CEngi\u001b[Ceer(Amalthea)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[37m: calling creat\u001b[C_commen\u001b[26;2H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
