[0.001, "o", "\u001b[93mntities, each verified by d\u001b[Ccrypt\u001b[Cng the\u001b[Cname literal f\u001b[Cd to the GetProcAdd\u001b[2Css call that produced the slot\r\nvalue (ba\u001b[2C64+RC4, key CgeOvEO7hu):\u001b[39m                                           \r\n                                                                                     \r\n\u001b[93m- 0x1400b4e28 ← hFvtYkwIp3/c6A== = \u001b[1mOpenEventW\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m (r\u001b[Csolved @ 0x14003c1c6)\u001b[39m                \r\n\u001b[93m- 0x1400b4e30 ← iFntbX0bh2fN0dh6 = \u001b[1mCreateEventW\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m (@ 0x14003c1f1)\u001b[39m                  \r\n\u001b[93m- 0x1400\u001b[C4e38 ← mEftaXk= =\u001b[C\u001b[1mSleep\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m (@ 0x14003c21c)\u001b[39m                                                \r\n\u001b[93m- 0x1400b4d58 ← iEfnf2w2o3/M08k= = \u001b[1mCloseHandle\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m (@ 0x14003c176)\u001b[39m                                 \r\n\u001b[93m- \u001b[Cx1400b4ea0 ← jE78\u001b[C2YTsmTc2t5j8di3fA== = \u001b[1mGetComputerNameW\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m (@ 0\u001b[C1400\u001b[Cc247)\u001b[39m          "]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n                                                                                     \r\n\u001b[93mBehavior: if anoth\u001b[Cr instance already holds the event, the new instance polls every ~4.1 s until it disappears, then\r\ncreates the event and proceeds. CreateMutex/OpenMutex do NOT exist anywhere: not in the static import table and not in\r\nthe encrypted string table (searched for their deterministic RC4-ciphertext base64 prefixes iFntbX0bj2Tc / hFvtYkQL —\r\nzero hits). The Sleep(0x100A) loop is an instance-wait, not a sandbox timing evasion.\u001b[24;63H\u001b[36m\u001b[1m⠏ \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[90mThinking…\u001b[39m \u001b[35m\u001b[1mRevers\u001b[CEngine\u001b[3CElara)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[37m: calling create_com\u001b[Cent\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
