[0.002, "o", "\u001b[4;3H\u001b[97m\u001b[1mN\u001b[Cw expiry-gate item\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m: the build-expiry date kill-sw\u001b[Ctch\u001b[Cis\u001b[1m builder-configurable in V2\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m — absent in the 2025-04 build\u001b[39m \r\n\u001b[97m(build A),\u001b[1m present\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m in the current build (build B). It records the generic implementation pattern (WinMain-level helper\r\nconcaten\u001b[Cting 4 small 2-char d\u001b[Ccrypted string-tabl\u001b[C entries\u001b[Cvia \u001b[Ctring\u001b[Ctr\u001b[Cam →\u001b[93m std::get_time\u001b[C\u001b[97mwith\u001b[93m \"%d/%m/%Y\"\u001b[C\u001b[97m→\u001b[39m        \r\n\u001b[93mmktime(expiry) < mktime(now)\u001b[97m gating the orchestrator; parse failure →\u001b[93m ExitProcess(0)\u001b[97m), a\u001b[1m per-sample check recipe\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m (grep\r\n\u001b[93m%d/%m/%Y\u001b[97m in .rdata; find the 4-entry concatenator; find the mktime gate), and the\u001b[C\u001b[1ma\u001b[Cti-sandbox note\u001b[3C\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97mat post-expiry\u001b[39m \r\n\u001b[97mdetonations look benign —\u001b[Cbackda\u001b[Ce the clock in dyna\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97mmic analysis.\u001b[39m                                                     \r\n\u001b[97m- \u001b[1mDiagnostic combo section\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m now explicitly warns never \u001b[Co u\u001b[Ce the gate'\u001b[C presence/absence as a V2 discriminator.\r\n- Description and tags updated (\u001b[93mkill-switch\u001b[97m,\u001b[93m expiry-date\u001b[97m added) so future runs searching for expiry/kill-switch topics\r\nfind it.\u001b[CNo\u001b[Csample hashes, addr\u001b[Csses, \u001b[Cr session-specific IOCs were put in the m\u001b[Cmory — the concrete evidence stays on\r\nthe forum (#q-main-flow\u001b[C!56, #finding-expiry-date-killswitch).\u001b[39m   \r\n                                                                                                               \r\n\u001b[97m\u001b[1mForum record\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m (!80\u001b[Cunder #finding-expiry-date-killswitch): \u001b[Cocumented \u001b[Che curation a\u001b[Ct\u001b[Con, and posted one pre-registered\r\nhypothesis for th\u001b[2CRE t\u001b[Cam: the four table entrie\u001b[C (\"11\",\"04\",\"20\",\"25\") imply\u001b[Ca c\u001b[Cncrete \u001b[Cxpiry of\u001b[1m 11 April 2025\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m\u001b[3m if\u001b(B\u001b[m  \r\n\u001b[93mbuild_expiry_date_string_from_table\u001b[97m @ 0\u001b[C14002a4c0 inserts\u001b[93m /\u001b[97m separators — flagged as needing one decompile check before\r\npromotion to a conclusion.\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                                                                       \r\n\u001b[31m●\u001b[39m \u001b[90mDeveloper(Sinope) · ▸ complete_task(rhai-dev) · 88 chars\u001b[39m                                                          \r\n                                                                                                                      \r\n\u001b[31m●\u001b[39m \u001b[90mDeveloper(Sinope) · ▸ complete_task(rhai-dev) · 88 chars\u001b[24;68H\u001b[39m \u001b[36m\u001b[1m⠇ \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[90mThinking…\u001b[39m \u001b[35m\u001b[1mDeveloper(Sinope)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[37m: ca\u001b[Cling co\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[37mmplete_task\u001b[26;2H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
