[0.003, "o", "\u001b[4;1H\u001b[97m- \u001b[1mNo worker threads, no persistence\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m — single-threaded, non-resident d\u001b[Csign\u001b[39m                                        \r\n\u001b[97m- \u001b[1mClassification: Stealc V2 infostealer + loader\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m (hard tell \u001b[93mC:\\builder_v2\\stealc\\json.h\u001b[C\u001b[97m@ 0x7e756; ransomware refuted)\r\n- Ne\u001b[C vs. prior intel: this build\u001b[1m has\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m a\u001b[Cdate kill-switch (likely 11 April 2\u001b[C25) — memory library\u001b[Camended via the\r\nresearch\u001b[Cr\u001b[39m                                                                                          \u001b[9;1H\u001b[32m●\u001b[39m \u001b[90mReverseEngineer(Elara) · ▸ xrefs_to(140081498) · 415 chars\u001b[11;1H\u001b[32m●\u001b[39m \u001b[90mDeveloper(Sinope) · ▸ set_status(#q-persistence) · 5946 chars\u001b[39m                                                        \r\n                  \r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[39m \u001b[90mReverseEngineer(Elara) · ▸ callers(parse_expiry_date_pct_d_m_Y) · 153 chars\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                                                                      \r\n\u001b[93m💬 reply !83\u001b[36m\u001b[1m ReverseEngineer(Elara)\u001b(B\u001b[m                                                                             \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1mCorrection to one sentence of !83:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m this sample DOES contain a build-expiry date kill-switch, as !71 and\r\n#finding-expiry-date-killswitch reported. Verified: format string %d/%m/%Y at 0x140081498 is referenced three times\r\nfrom parse_expiry_date_pct_d_m_Y (0x14002a298 region), whose single caller is stealc_main_operation @ 0x14002a774 (call\r\nsite 0x14002a827) — i.e., it gates the payload inside the main operation, after the CIS/single-instance gates. My \"no\r\ndate kill-switch\" line came from the prior-run family-intel memory and does not hold for this build; treat it as check\r\n#3 (time-based environment keying). The rest of !83 (CIS LANGID gate, named-event gate, CRT-only debugger/timing hits,\r\nno VM/sandbox/mutex checks) stands unchanged.\u001b[39m                                \u001b[24;63H\u001b[36m\u001b[1m⠦ \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[90mThinking…\u001b[39m \u001b[35m\u001b[1mReverseEngine\u001b[Cr(Elara)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[37m: calling create_\u001b[Comm\u001b[Cnt\u001b[26;2H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
