[0.003, "o", "\u001b[4;1H\u001b[97m\u001b[1mGenuine malware-authored checks (sample confirmed as Stealc v2 —\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m C:\\builder_v2\\stealc\\\u001b[97m\u001b[1m tell, RC4 string key\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m CgeOvEO7hu\u001b[97m\u001b[1m,\r\nbuild ID\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m 512e7bd984984fb6\u001b[97m\u001b[1m):\u001b(B\u001b[m                           \r\n                                                \r\n\u001b[94m1.\u001b[97m\u001b[1m CIS locale kill switch\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m (!77) —\u001b[93m stealc_ma\u001b[Cn_cis_loc\u001b[2Ce_and_singl\u001b[C_instance_gate\u001b[C\u001b[97m@ 0x14002a88c c\u001b[Clls runtime-resolved\r\n\u001b[93mGetUserDefaultLangID\u001b[97m (slot 0x1400b4e10) @ 0x14002a96d; LANGID ∈ {0x419 ru, 0x422 uk, 0x423 be, 0x43F kk, 0x443 uz-Latn}\r\n→\u001b[93m ExitProcess(0)\u001b[97m. Decode verified bid\u001b[Crectionally (decrypt lit\u001b[Cral → n\u001b[Cme; re-encrypt name → literal).\u001b[39m                \r\n\u001b[94m2.\u001b[97m\u001b[1m Named-event single-instance gate\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m (!79) —\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m OpenEv\u001b[CntW(0x1F0003)\u001b[97m poll\u001b[Cloop (CloseHandle + Sleep 4106 ms)\u001b[Cthen\u001b[39m        \r\n\u001b[93mCreateEventW\u001b[97m; event name =\u001b[93m <numeric>_<ComputerName>_<UserName>\u001b[97m. All f\u001b[Cve API slots verified by decrypting their name\r\nliterals. No mutex anywhere.\r\n\u001b[94m3.\u001b[97m\u001b[1m Build-expiry da\u001b[2C kill-swit\u001b[Ch\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m (!88, correcting !83) —\u001b[93m parse_expiry_date_pct_d_m_Y\u001b[97m (\u001b[93m%d/%m/%Y\u001b[97m @ 0x140081498), called\u001b[39m  \u001b[14;2H\u001b[97mrom\u001b[93m stealc_main_operation\u001b[97m @ 0x14002\u001b[C827.\u001b[39m                                                              \u001b[16;1H\u001b[97m\u001b[1mAbsent (proven, !81):\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m no anti-debug, anti-VM, sandbox detection, or timing checks in malware code — verified by\r\nsearching the\u001b[Cencrypted\u001b[Cst\u001b[Cing tab\u001b[Ce for \u001b[Ceterministic\u001b[CRC4-cipher\u001b[Cext base64 pr\u001b[Cfixes of IsDebuggerPresent,\u001b[39m  \r\n\u001b[97mCheckRemoteDebuggerPre\u001b[2Cnt, NtQueryInformationProcess, GetTickCount, QueryPerformanceCounter, VMware,\r\nCreateMutex/OpenMutex (zero hits; method validated on a known pair).\r\n\u001b[39m \u001b[C                                                                     \r\n\u001b[97mCross-posted the recovered RC4 key/pipeline to #q-string-table (!84) and annotated the kill-switch in Ghidra @\r\n0x14002a96d.\u001b[39m                                                            \u001b[26;2H"]
