[0.005, "o", "\u001b[4;3H\u001b[93mExfil artifa\u001b[Ct names (passwords.txt, system_\u001b[Cnfo.txt, screenshot.jpg, v10.txt, v20.txt, ...) and archive structure\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                             \r\n\u001b[93m📌 #q-\u001b[Co\u001b[Cder-tasks — Loader task handlers and remaining\u001b[CC2 m\u001b[Cs\u001b[Cage builders\u001b[36m\u001b[1m main\u001b(B\u001b[m                                    \r\n\u001b[93mResiduals from #q-networking (!69): confirm the exact behavior of\r\n\u001b[39m \u001b[C                                                                              \r\n\u001b[93m- Task dispatch @ 0x140029900 and handlers FUN_140028e58 / FUN_140029224: expected task types 0 = download+ShellExecute\r\nEXE, 1 = PowerShell IEX, 2 = msiexec MSI — recover the exact command lines (powershell/msiexec/runas strings were seen\r\nin the\u001b[2Cecoded table)\u001b[39m                                                                                                  \r\n\u001b[93m- The two remaining\u001b[CPOST\u001b[Cbuilders FUN_140026a84 and FUN_14000b690: what JSON type v\u001b[Crbs do they send\u001b[39m                  \r\n\u001b[93m(sysinfo/scr\u001b[Censhot report?)\u001b[14;3HW\u001b[2Cre downloaded payloads ar\u001b[C written (temp paths, filenames)\u001b[39m                                     \r\n                            \r\n\u001b[93m📌 #q-\u001b[Cxpiry-d\u001b[Ct\u001b[C — What i\u001b[2Cth\u001b[2Cexac\u001b[C build-ex\u001b[Ciry (kil\u001b[C-switch) date?\u001b[36m\u001b[1m main\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m#q-main-flow found a build-expiry kill-switch: date parsed with %d/%m/%Y @ 0x14002a298, assembled as E1/E2/E3E4 from 4\r\ndecrypted string-table entries @ 0x14002a4c0, checked in \u001b[Ctealc_main_operation @ 0x14002a827; \"likely 11 April 2025\"\r\nbut not confirmed.\u001b[CDecode the 4 table entries used and \u001b[Ctate \u001b[2Ce exact expiry date and the comparison semantics\u001b[C(what\u001b[39m \r\n\u001b[93mhappens when current date is past it).\u001b[39m                                                                              \r\n                                                                                                                     \r\n\u001b[90m○\u001b[39m \u001b[90mmain · ▸ spawn_swarm(Complete the static analysis of a Steal…) · …running\u001b[24;110H\u001b[37mspawn_swarm\u001b[26;2H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
