[0.006, "o", "\u001b[4;1H                                                       \r\n\u001b[93m- Per config rule (fields csidl, start_path, masks, recursive, max_size, iterations from #q-string-table). csidl enum\r\n0–6 maps via shgetfolderpatha_csidl_to_string to SHGetFolderPathA CSIDLs: 0→0x1C CSIDL_LOCAL_APPDATA, 1→0x1A\r\nCSIDL_APPDATA, 2→0x10 CSIDL_DESKTOPDIRECTORY, 3→0x28 CSIDL_PROFILE, 4→0x05 CSIDL_PERSONAL (Documents), 5→0x26\r\nCSIDL_PROGRAM_FILES, 6→0x2A CSIDL_PROGRAM_FILESX86 (verified in the switch on param_2+0x24).\r\n- Appends start_path, then calls grabber_enum_dir_match_masks_read_upload_recursive @ 0x1400093ec-area\r\n(FindFirstFileA/FindNextFileA walk, PathMatchSpecA against comma-split masks, max_size/iterations caps, optional\r\nrecursion) — each matching file is read and uploaded under the files category (slot 0x1400b1610).\r\n- Driven by the orchestrator loop over the C2-provided files rule array (rules are\u001b[1m server-configured\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m, no hardcoded\r\nmasks in the binary except Steam's).\u001b[39m                                                                                  \r\n                                                                                       \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1mSteam — \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93msteal_steam_configvdf_ssfn_files\u001b[1m @ 0x140037704\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m (gated by orchestrator flag byte local_65 = config steal_steam)\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                                                                 \r\n\u001b[93m- RegOpenKeyExA\u001b[1m HKCU (0x80000001)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m Software\\Va\u001b[Cve\\S\u001b[Ceam (slot 0x1400b0b10), RegQueryValueExA SteamPath (0x1400b1690),\u001b[39m \r\n\u001b[93mappends \\\u001b[Config\\ (0x1400b03f0).\u001b[39m                                                                               \r\n\u001b[93m- Builds a synthetic grabber rule: name Steam (0x1400b21d0), masks\u001b[39m                                                   \r\n\u001b[93mssfn*,config.vdf,DialogConfig.vdf,DialogConfigOverlay*.vdf,libraryfolders.vdf,loginuse\u001b[Cs.vdf (0x1400b1a50),\u001b[39m            \r\n\u001b[93mrecursive=1, csidl-override=3 (fields local_250=1, local_298=3, iterations=5, max_size=10) and feeds it to the same\u001b[39m  \r\n\u001b[93mgrabber @ 0x140008b30 ⇒ steals Steam SSFN auth files + account/library VDFs.\u001b[24;63H\u001b[39m \u001b[36m\u001b[1m⠧ \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[90mThinking…\u001b[39m \u001b[35m\u001b[1mReverseEngin\u001b[Cer(Leda)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[37m: calling create\u001b[26;2H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
