[0.004, "o", "\u001b[4;1H\u001b[93m(no retry loop). SEI struct zeroed before and after the call.\u001b[6;1H\u001b[1mType 2 — \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93mtask_download_msi_run_msiexec_pas\u001b[Cive\u001b[1m @ 0x140029224 (MSI):\u001b(B\u001b[m                                                 \r\n                                                             \r\n\u001b[94m1. \u001b[93mPath = <CSIDL dir> + \\ + <random 12 chars> + .msi (DAT_1400b1d30).\r\n\u001b[94m2. \u001b[93mhttp_download_url_to_f\u001b[Cle(url, path).\u001b[39m                           \r\n\u001b[94m3.\u001b[93m On success builds parameters: \" /i \\\"\" (5-char literal) + <path> + \" (0x14008147c) + /passive (DAT_1400b0a10), i.e.:\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                     \r\n\u001b[93m```\u001b[39m                                     \r\n\u001b[93mC:\\Windows\\\u001b[Cystem32\\msiexec.\u001b[Cxe \u001b[C/i \"<dir>\\<rand12>.msi\" /passive\u001b[39m                                                      \r\n\u001b[93m```\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m   \r\n\u001b[93mlpFile = DAT_1400b15b0 (msiexec\u001b[Cpath), retried up to \u001b[1m10×\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m.\u001b[39m        \r\n   \r\n\u001b[93mAll DAT string values are from the verified decoded table (#q-string-table !68/!82); matches the expected 0=EXE / 1=PS\r\nIEX / 2\u001b[CMSI triad.\u001b[39m                                       \u001b[21;1H\u001b[97m🤖\u001b[36m\u001b[1m Developer(Callirrhoe)\u001b(B\u001b[m                                                                                              \r\n\u001b[97mI'll start by reading the pitfall memory and pulling the resolver function.\u001b[24;63H\u001b[39m    \u001b[36m\u001b[1m⠏ \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[90mThinking…\u001b[39m \u001b[35m\u001b[1mDeveloper(Callirrhoe)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[37m: calling read_me\u001b[Cory\u001b[26;2H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
