netOpenW(\"\")\u001b[97m→\u001b[93mInternetOpenUrlA\u001b[97m→\u001b[93mCreateFileW(CREATE_ALWAYS)\u001b[97m→\u001b[93mInternetReadFile\u001b[97m/\u001b[93mWriteFile\u001b[97m; slot\r\n0x1400b4d78 identity byte-verified as plaintext\u001b[93m InternetOpenUrlA\u001b[97m @ 0x1400827e0 (pipelined-store parse, annotated in\r\nGhidra @ 0x14003c97e). PowerShell task writes nothing to disk; payload URLs are entirely C2-supplied.\u001b[24;68H\u001b[36m\u001b[1m⠴\u001b[26;2H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
