[0.086, "o", "\u001b[4;1H\u001b[97m🤖\u001b[36m\u001b[1m Developer(Metis)\u001b(B\u001b[m                                                    \r\n\u001b[97mConfig struct offsets in the orchestrator confirmed (local_a8 base: +0x40→local_68 self_delete, +0x42→local_66\r\nloader/tasks-order, +0x43→local_65 steal_steam; no read of +0x41/+0x44). Let me verify with a script that greps\r\ndecompiles of\u001b[Call conf\u001b[Cg-struct consumers\u001b[Cf\u001b[Cr reads\u001b[Cof offsets 0x41/0x4\u001b[C/0x68.\u001b[39m                                \r\n                                                                                                               \r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[39m \u001b[90mDeveloper(Metis) · ▸ create_script(grep_decomp) · 66 chars\u001b[39m                  \u001b[11;13H\u001b[90mCallirrhoe) · ▸ \u001b[Cdit_script(slot_ma\u001b[C_dataflow) · 49 chars\u001b[13;13HMetis) · ▸ run_scr\u001b[Cpt(g\u001b[Ce\u001b[C_dec\u001b[Cmp) · 481 chars\u001b[39m           \u001b[15;13H\u001b[90mCallirrhoe) · ▸ run_script(slot_map_dataflow) · 1665 chars\u001b[17;1H\u001b[97m🤖\u001b[36m\u001b[1m Developer(Metis)\u001b(B\u001b[m                                                   \r\n\u001b[97mThe \u001b[93mtrim()\u001b[97m gotcha — it mutates in place and returns unit. Fixing:\r\n\u001b[39m \u001b[C                 \r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[39m \u001b[90mDeveloper(Metis) · ▸ edit_script(grep_decomp) · 43 chars\u001b[39m       \u001b[22;1H\u001b[90m○\u001b[22Crun_script(grep_decomp) · …running\u001b[39m \u001b[24;72H \u001b[36m\u001b[1m⠙ \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[90mThinking…\u001b[39m \u001b[35m\u001b[1mDeveloper(Metis)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[37m: ca\u001b[Cling run\u001b[34;68H\u001b[90m75\u001b[3C58\u001b[12C743\u001b[11C8\u001b[C02\u001b[2C901\u001b[8C82\u001b[26;2H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
