[0.005, "o", "\u001b[4;1H                                                                 \r\n\u001b[97m🤖\u001b[36m\u001b[1m Developer(Callirrhoe)\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97mDataflow mapping complete — all calls went through pfn slot\u001b[93m 0x1400b4df8\u001b[97m (100×) vs\u001b[93m 0x1400b4df0\u001b[97m (10× = the LoadLibraryA\r\ncalls). Now I need to: (1) cross-check each store site against Ghidra's xrefs_to write refs, (2) confirm 0x1400b4df8 is\r\npfn_GetProcAddress, (3) independently re-decode each name from its ciphertext. First let me check xref shapes and the\r\ninit function size.\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                                          \r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[C\u001b[90mDeveloper(Callirrhoe) · ▸ create_script(xref_check) · 65 chars\r\n\u001b[39m \u001b[C                      \r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[39m \u001b[90mDeveloper(Callirrhoe) · ▸ get_function(0x140002b6c) · 283 chars\u001b[39m                                                    \r\n                                                                                                                       \r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[39m \u001b[90mDeveloper(Callirrhoe) · ▸ run_script(xref_check) · 18564 chars\u001b[39m                                                     \r\n                   \r\n\u001b[97m🤖\u001b[36m\u001b[1m Developer(Callirrhoe)\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m0x1400b4df8\u001b[97m is written once @ 0x14003c117 in the core resolver and read at all 110 GetProcAddress call sites (incl. all\r\n13 of mine);\u001b[93m 0x1400b4df0\u001b[97m is the LoadLibraryA pfn. Let me confirm the bootstrap identity and get the WRITE xrefs for the\r\n13 slots.\u001b[39m                                                        \u001b[22;1H\u001b[90m○\u001b[27Cedit_script(xref_check) · …running\u001b[39m  \u001b[24;67H\u001b[36m\u001b[1m⠙ \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[90mThinking…\u001b[39m \u001b[35m\u001b[1mDeveloper(Cal\u001b[Cir\u001b[Choe)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[37m: cal\u001b[Cing edit\u001b[26;2H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
