[0.005, "o", "\u001b[4;1H\u001b[93m- Exfil layout = plugins/<plugin name>/... (category slot 0x1400b0a30). The wallets string (0x1400b21f0) is a separate\u001b[39m \r\n\u001b[93mexfil category used only by the grabber engine (xref 0x1400084a4) for wallet-type file rules.\u001b[39m                          \r\n\u001b[93m-\u001b[1m No extension IDs / wallet names are hardcoded\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m — the entire target list (MetaMask etc.) is server-supplied in the\u001b[39m     \r\n\u001b[93mconfig plugins\u001b[Carray;\u001b[Cdesktop-wallet\u001b[Cfile theft (Exodus/Electrum-style)\u001b[Carrives as se\u001b[Cver-supplied files grabber rules\u001b[39m \r\n\u001b[93mtagged\u001b[Cwallets.\u001b[39m                                                                                                        \r\n                                                                                                                       \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1mOutlook:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m s\u001b[Ceal_outlook\u001b[1m is parsed but DEAD in this build.\u001b[C\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93mConfig\u001b[Cparser\u001b[Cwrites it to\u001b[Cstruct +0x44 (site 0x140025db1);\u001b[39m   \r\n\u001b[93mdeveloper\u001b[Cxref/decompile\u001b[Caudit\u001b[Cof\u001b[Call config-struct\u001b[Cconsumers\u001b[Cfound\u001b[1m zero readers\u001b[C\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93mof\u001b[C+0x44,\u001b[Cand\u001b[Cthere\u001b[Cis\u001b[Cno\u001b[COutlook\u001b[Ccode\r\nat all: search_memory(\"Outlook\") and\u001b[Csearch_memory(\"9375CFF0\")\u001b[C(the\u001b[COutlook\u001b[CProfiles \u001b[Cegistry GUID) = 0 h\u001b[Cts, and\u001b[Cthe\u001b[39m  \r\n\u001b[93mcomplete 276-entry decoded\u001b[Cstring\u001b[Ctable\u001b[Ccontains\u001b[Cno\u001b[COutlook/IMAP/SMTP/Profiles\u001b[Cstrings —\u001b[Cthe\u001b[Conly\u001b[COutlook-related\u001b[39m      \r\n\u001b[93mpla\u001b[Cn\u001b[Cext\u001b[Cis the JSON key\u001b[Csteal_outlook itself.\u001b[39m                                                                        \r\n                                                                                                                       \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1mDiscord / Telegram / email / FTP clients: no dedicated collectors.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m The decoded string table (all 276 entries,\r\n#q-string-tab\u001b[Ce !59\u001b[C!63/!68) contains no\u001b[CDiscord, Telegram, tdata, FileZilla, Pidgin, or mail-client strings, and the\r\norchestrator @ 0x140029f68 has no further collection branches beyond browsers/plugins/files/Steam/screenshot/sysinfo.\r\nSuch apps can only be hit indirectly via\u001b[Cserver-suppli\u001b[Cd files grabber rules (e.g. a rule po\u001b[2Cting\u001b[Ccsidl=1\u001b[39m        \r\n\u001b[93mst\u001b[Crt_path=discord\\Local Storage\\l\u001b[Cveldb).\u001b[39m                                                                   \r\n                                                                                                                       \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1mHardcoded app targets in the binary = exactly one: Steam\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m (0x140037704, see !96).\u001b[26;2H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
