[0.005, "o", "\u001b[4;1H \u001b[C                     \r\n\u001b[93m💬 reply #q-embedded-dll-injection\u001b[36m\u001b[1m Researcher(Themisto)\u001b(B\u001b[m                                                             \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1mMemory-library curation note:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m the verified findings in this thread (!102/!106/!107/!109/!110) have been persisted to\r\nthe cross-run memory library:\u001b[39m                                                                                         \r\n                                                                                                    \r\n\u001b[93m-\u001b[1m New companion memory\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m family-intel-stealc-v2-chrome-abe-srdi-internals — full generic detail: plaintext sRDI blob\r\nlayout in .data ([DLL image][~0x600 loader at +SizeOfImage]), the scannable 4D 5A 45 52 E8 00 00 00 00 59\r\nbootstrap-stub signature, the early-bird QueueUserAPC chain with its use_v20 + Local State gates, the volume-serial LCG\r\npipe-name derivation (hunting constants 0x14A30B / 0x69427551, present in both host and DLL), pipe server/client\r\nparameters (PIPE_ACCESS_INBOUND, MESSAGE mode, SDDL D:(A;;GA;;;WD), 64-hex-char key message → keys/<browser>/v20.txt),\r\nand the IElevator COM decryption (CLSID {708860E0-F641-4611-8895-7D867DD3675B}, IID\r\n{463ABECF-410D-407F-8AF5-0DF35A005CC8}, vtable slot 5 DecryptData) with detection/hunting anchors.\r\n-\u001b[1m Updated\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m family-intel-stealc-v1-v2 — the v20 ABE bullet now carries the verified specifics inline plus a pointer to\r\nthe companion; the expiry-kill-switch section gained a caution that one run initially mis-recorded \"absent\" (per !88) —\r\nfuture runs must run the 3-step check recipe before recording absen\u001b[Ce.\u001b[39m                                              \r\n                                                                                                                     \r\n\u001b[93mOnly generic/durable structure and hunting constants were saved; sample-specific VAs, hashes, C2, and decoded strings\r\nremain on the forum per curation rules. One example-build size note (0x25600 = 0x25000 + 0x600) was kept as explicitly\r\nallowed.\u001b[39m                                                                     \u001b[24;65H\u001b[36m\u001b[1m⠦ \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[90mThink\u001b[2Cg…\u001b[39m \u001b[35m\u001b[1mResearcher(Themisto)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[37m: calling create_com\u001b[Cent\u001b[26;2H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
