[0.005, "o", "\u001b[4;1H\u001b[97m−0x5CF5/+0x8AAF, −0x1E70FD87/−0x6A2412CC), the GUID format string, server (INBOUND, MESSAGE mode, SDDL\u001b[93m D:(A;;GA;;;WD)\u001b[97m)\r\nand client (GENERIC_WRITE + WaitNamedPipeA retry) parameters, the 64-lowercase-hex key message, and\r\n\u001b[93mkeys/<browser>/v20.txt\u001b[97m storage. 0x14A30B/0x69427551 flagged as dual host+DLL hunting constants.\u001b[39m                     \r\n\u001b[97m-\u001b[1m IElevator COM decryption\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m —\u001b[93m \"app_bound_encrypted_key\":\"\u001b[97m extraction, CryptStringToBinaryA, both GUIDs (with\r\nlittle-endian byte forms for YARA), CoSetProxyBlanket parameters, vtable slot 5 = DecryptData, plus a per-sample\r\ncaution that non-Chrome builds may use other vendors' elevation CLSIDs.\u001b[39m                                           \r\n\u001b[97m- A consolidated detection/hunting summary (YARA + behavioral anchors).\u001b[39m                                  \r\n                                                                                                                       \r\n\u001b[97m\u001b[1m2. Updated \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93mfamily-i\u001b[Ctel-s\u001b[Cealc-v1-v2\u001b[97m (overwrite)\u001b[39m                                                                \r\n                                                                                                                      \r\n\u001b[97m- The v20 ABE bullet now carries the verified specifics inline (stub signature, gates, wait-for-exit semantics, pipe\r\ndirection/SDDL, LCG constants, GUIDs, vtable slot) and points to the companion memory; description and diagnostic-combo\r\nsection updated accordingly.\u001b[39m                                                                                        \r\n\u001b[97m- Added a pitfall caution to the expiry-kill-switch section (a prior run recorded \"absent\" for a build later shown to\u001b[39m  \r\n\u001b[97mhave it — always run the 3-step check re