[0.007, "o", "\u001b[4;1H                                                                                     \r\n\u001b[93mThe very first entry is NULL. The Windows loader (and the CRT's __dyn_tls_init) walk this array until the first NULL\r\npointer, so\u001b[1m zero callbacks are registered\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m. The two NULL qwords are the linker's .CRT$XLA/.CRT$XLZ sentinels with\r\nnothing em\u001b[Ctted between\u001b[Cthem — exactly \u001b[Chat MSVC\u001b[Cpro\u001b[Cuces\u001b[Cwhen the program declares no __declspec(\u001b[Chread)\u001b[Ccallbacks and\r\nn\u001b[C manual _tls_used entries.\u001b[39m                                                                                    \r\n                                                                                                                       \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1m3. The pointers after the terminator are NOT callbacks\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m: 0x1400538b4 is FID-identified CRT __acrt_uninitialize_locale\r\n(\"Library Function - Single Match\", VS2017/2019 Release) and 0x140065804 is a 28-byte \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93mstub in the same CRT region —\r\nthese belong to the adjacent CRT uninitializer pointer table that merely follows th\u001b[C TLS sentinels \u001b[2C .rdata; they sit\r\n\u001b[1mafter\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m the\u001b[CNULL terminator and are never reached\u001b[Cby the TLS-callback walk. xrefs_to 0x14006fc68 shows no code references\r\neith\u001b[Cr (only\u001b[2Che loader/TLS directory consum\u001b[C it).\u001b[39m                                                                    \r\n                                                                                                                       \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1mConclusion:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m the TLS \u001b[Ci\u001b[Cectory exists only because the statically-linked MSVC 14.43 CRT always emits _tls_used (8-byte\r\nTLS template, _tls_index, aligned-4 characteristics). There is\u001b[1m no TLS-callback anti-debug or early-init code\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m; this\r\ncloses the last\u001b[Canti-analysis\u001b[Cgap consistently with #q-an\u001b[2C-\u001b[Cnalys\u001b[Cs (!83/!88): the samp\u001b[Ce's only genuine anti-analysis\r\nis th\u001b[C CIS locale gate, the nam\u001b[3Cevent single-instance gate, the build-expiry kill-switch, and the\u001b[39m               \r\n\u001b[93mstring-encryption/runtime-API-resolution obfuscation layer.\u001b[39m                                                            \r\n                                                                                                   \r\n\u001b[90m○\u001b[39m \u001b[90mReverseEngineer(Megaclite) · ▸ complete_task(ReverseEngineer(Megaclite)) · …running\u001b[24;59H\u001b[39m \u001b[36m\u001b[1m⠇ \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[90mThinking…\u001b[39m \u001b[35m\u001b[1mReverseEngin\u001b[Cer(Megaclite)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[37m: ca\u001b[Cling complete_task\u001b[26;2H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
