[0.011, "o", "\u001b[4;3H\u001b[97m           \u001b[C       \u001b[9C \u001b[C    \u001b[C           \u001b[27Cis the ABE named-pipe security-descriptor \u001b[5;76Hcode @\u001b[C0x14001f3ee        \u001b[C    \u001b[C        \u001b[6;3H\u001b[1m0x14003cce9\u001b[C\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m(call)\u001b[10C\u001b[93mReadFile\u001b[37C(*pfn_GetProcAddress)(kernel32, name)\u001b[97m —  \u001b[7;76Hnam\u001b[2Cfrom decoded slot\u001b[C0x1400b1790\u001b[C(token\u001b[8;3H           \u001b[C      \u001b[10C        \u001b[37C@ 0x14007df50 \u001b[93mmU7paE8XrnQ=\u001b[97m)          \u001b[C \u001b[9;3H\u001b[1m0x14003cd0c\u001b[C\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m(store)\u001b[9C→\u001b[Cslot\u001b[C\u001b[1m0x1400b4dd0\u001b[27C\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97mPip\u001b[Clined\u001b[Cstore of the\u001b[CReadFile poin\u001b[Cer; \u001b[10;76Hconsumed by 4\u001b[Cfile-reading routines\u001b[C(incl.\u001b[11;3H           \u001b[C       \u001b[9C \u001b[C    \u001b[C           \u001b[27C\u001b[93mread_entire_file_to_localalloc_buffer\u001b[97m,  \u001b[12;76HChrome Local Stat\u001b[C d\u001b[Ccrypto\u001b[C)      \u001b[C      \r\n\u001b[90m└──────────\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[90m─────────────────┴────────────────────────────────────────────┴────────────────────────────────────────────┘\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                                                                       \r\n\u001b[97mVerification was done by two independent routes: (1) raw-byte RIP-relative stanza decoding (\u001b[93mrip_scan\u001b[97m session script,\u001b[39m   \r\n\u001b[97mbypassing the 100-instruction disassembly cap), and (2) native\u001b[93m decode_bytes [base64 → RC4(\"CgeOvEO7hu\")]\u001b[97m re-decode of\r\neach name token (\u001b[93mverify_tokens\u001b[97m). The slot→nam\u001b[C pairings explicitly appl\u001b[Ced\u001b[Cthe\u001b[39m                                      \r\n\u001b[93mpitfall-pipelined-getprocaddress-slot-stores\u001b[97m rule —\u001b[Ceach s\u001b[Cor\u001b[C saves the\u001b[3m previous\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m call's result — and each slot was\u001b[39m  \r\n\u001b[97mcross-ch\u001b[Ccked against its consumer-side xrefs.\u001b[CI also persisted the findings in the Ghidra project (renamed both slots\r\nto\u001b[93m pfn_Conv\u001b[CrtStringSecurityD\u001b[2CcriptorToSecurityDescriptorA\u001b[97m /\u001b[93m pfn_ReadFile\u001b[97m and left EOL commen\u001b[Cs at both cal\u001b[C site\u001b[C).\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                                                                      \r\n\u001b[90m○\u001b[39m \u001b[90mmain · ▸ finish() · …running\u001b[39m                                                                                       \u001b[24;67H           \u001b[C          \u001b[36m\u001b[1m⠼ \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[90mThinking…\u001b[39m \u001b[35m\u001b[1mmain\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[37m:\u001b[2Calling finish\u001b[26;2H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
