[0.007, "o", "\u001b[4;3H\u001b[97m\u001b[1m0x14003cd0c\u001b[C\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m(store)\u001b[9C→\u001b[Cslot\u001b[C\u001b[1m0x1400b4dd0\u001b[27C\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97mPipelined stor\u001b[C of the ReadFile pointer; \u001b[5;78Hnsumed by 4 \u001b[Cil\u001b[C-reading\u001b[Croutines\u001b[C(incl.\u001b[6;3H           \u001b[C      \u001b[10C        \u001b[37C\u001b[93mread_entire_file_to_localal\u001b[Coc_buff\u001b[Cr\u001b[97m, \u001b[7;76HChrome Local State decryptor)     \u001b[C      \r\n\u001b[90m└───────────────────────────┴────────────────────────────────────────────┴────────────────────────────────────────────┘\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                                                                       \r\n\u001b[97mVerification\u001b[Cwas\u001b[Cdone\u001b[Cby\u001b[Ctwo independent\u001b[Croutes:\u001b[C(1)\u001b[Craw-byte\u001b[CRIP-relative\u001b[Cstanza \u001b[Cecoding (\u001b[93mrip_scan\u001b[97m sessio\u001b[C \u001b[Ccr\u001b[Cpt,\u001b[39m   \r\n\u001b[97mbypassing\u001b[Cthe\u001b[C100-instruction\u001b[Cdisassembly\u001b[Ccap),\u001b[Cand\u001b[C(2)\u001b[Cnative\u001b[93m decode_bytes [bas\u001b[C64 → RC4(\"CgeOvEO7hu\")]\u001b[97m re-decode\u001b[Cof\u001b[39m  \r\n\u001b[97meach\u001b[Cname\u001b[Ctoken\u001b[C(\u001b[93mverify_tokens\u001b[97m).\u001b[CThe\u001b[Cslot→name\u001b[Cpairings\u001b[Cexplicitly\u001b[Capplied\u001b[Ct\u001b[Ce\u001b[39m                                         \r\n\u001b[93mpitfall-pipelined-getprocaddress-slot-stores\u001b[97m rule — each store saves the\u001b[3m previous\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m call's result — and each slot was\u001b[39m    \r\n\u001b[97mcross-checked against its consumer-side xrefs. I also persisted the findings in the Ghidra project (renamed both slots\r\nto\u001b[93m pfn_ConvertStringSecurityDescriptorToSecurityDescriptorA\u001b[97m /\u001b[93m pfn_ReadFile\u001b[C\u001b[97mand left EOL comments at both call sites).\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                                                                     \r\n\u001b[31m●\u001b[39m \u001b[90mmain · ▸ finish() · 307 chars\u001b[39m                                               \r\n                                                                                                                   \r\n\u001b[90m○\u001b[39m \u001b[90mmain · ▸ developer(Curate the persistent script library at…) · …running\u001b[39m                                             \r\n                                                                                                                     \r\n\u001b[97m🤖\u001b[36m\u001b[1m Developer(Chaldene)\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m▶ Developer(Chaldene) — goal: Curate the persistent script library at the end of the Stealc v2 analysis run.\u001b[24;10H\u001b[36m\u001b[1m⠏ \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[90mThinking…\u001b[C\u001b[35m\u001b[1mDeveloper(Chaldene)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[37m: Curate the persistent script library at the end of the Stealc v2 \u001b[Cnalysis run.\u001b[26;2H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
