[0.008, "o", "\u001b[4;1H\u001b[97m- Read 3 session sources before tool access was cut:\u001b[5;2H\u001b[93m decode_string_table\u001b[97m (xref-\u001b[Cairi\u001b[Cg\u001b[Cbase64+RC4 decoder) — fully args-parameterized and generic, but redundant with\r\nthr\u001b[Ce stronger libra\u001b[Cy routes already proven on\u001b[CStealc v2 (\u001b[93mharvest\u001b[97m,\u001b[93m rc4_b64_strings\u001b[97m,\r\n\u001b[93mrange_b64rc4\u001b[97m/\u001b[93mrda\u001b[2C_b64_native_scan\u001b[97m), \u001b[Cnd its xref-\u001b[Crder\u001b[Cpairing\u001b[Cheuristic is fragile. Only marginal\u001b[Cpromotion\u001b[Cvalue.\r\n-\u001b[93m verify_tokens\u001b[97m — superseded by library\u001b[93m verify_blobs\u001b[97m /\u001b[93m token_pipeline_decode\u001b[97m (which add NUL-truncation safety and\r\narbitrary pipelines). Skipped.\u001b[39m                                                                                      \r\n\u001b[97m    - \u001b[93mxref_check\u001b[97m — trivial 10-line \u001b[93mxrefs_to\u001b[97m WRITE filter, one-off. Skipped.\u001b[39m                                      \r\n                              \r\n\u001b[97m\u001b[1mWhy nothing was promoted:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m the only\u001b[Cread-and-generic candidat\u001b[Cs are\u001b[Credundant or trivial, and the remaining 7 scripts\r\n(\u001b[93mdisasm_window\u001b[97m and\u001b[93m slot_map_dataflow\u001b[97m — which shadow existing library scripts — plus\u001b[93m rip_scan\u001b[97m,\u001b[93m decode_name_slots\u001b[97m,\r\n\u001b[93mgrep_decomp\u001b[97m,\u001b[93m check_disasm_len\u001b[97m,\u001b[93m probe_disasm\u001b[97m) could not be read/verified before the context ceiling; promoting\u001b[39m       \r\n\u001b[97munverified or unread scripts would violate the library-quality rules.\u001b[39m                                           \r\n                                                                                                             \r\n\u001b[97m\u001b[1mWhat remains (documented in the forum post):\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m a\u001b[Cfuture cur\u001b[Ctor should read the 7 unread scripts, diff the two shadows\r\nagainst their library versions (overwrite-promote only if they contain fixes), and optionally promote\r\n\u001b[93mdecode_string_table\u001b[97m as a low-priority cross-check tool (suggested name\u001b[93m b64rc4_xref_pair_decode\u001b[97m)\u001b[Cw\u001b[Cth\u001b[5Cxref-or\u001b[Cer\u001b[39m \r\n\u001b[97mcaveat s\u001b[Cated\u001b[Chonestly.\u001b[39m                                                                              \r\n                                                                                                                   \r\n\u001b[90m○\u001b[39m \u001b[90mmain · ▸ finish() · …running\u001b[24;69H\u001b[39m           \u001b[C        \u001b[36m\u001b[1m⠸ \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[90mThinking…\u001b[39m \u001b[35m\u001b[1mmain\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[37m: calling fini\u001b[Ch\u001b[26;2H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
