[0.006, "o", "\u001b[4;1H\u001b[32m●\u001b[C\u001b[90mResearcher(Harpalyke) · ▸ search_memories(TLS callback) · 2 chars\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                                                  \r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[C\u001b[90mResearcher(Harpalyke) · ▸ search_memories(deterministic ciphertext) · 2 chars\r\n\u001b[39m \u001b[C                                                                           \r\n\u001b[97m🤖\u001b[36m\u001b[1m Researcher(Harpalyke)\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97mThe family memory already covers candidate 1 (expiry kill-switch, including the 4-entry\u001b[93m %d/%m/%Y\u001b[97m assembly, silent clean\r\nexit, and clock-backdating advice — amended earlier per !80/!111) and candidates 3/4 exist as pitfalls. Candidate 2's\r\ndetails (exact verb set\u001b[93m create/loader/upload_file/done\u001b[97m, task-type ints, drop paths) are NOT fully in the family memory\r\n— it still records an older\u001b[93m loginr\u001b[97m verb \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97mand lacks the loader-task specifics, so I'll amend it. Candidates 5 and 6 have\r\nno existing memory (searches returned nothing) — I'll save them as new techniques.\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                                                                       \r\n\u001b[31m●\u001b[39m \u001b[90mResearcher(Harpalyke) · ▸ save_memory(technique-prove-string-absence-fixed-rc…) · 41 chars\u001b[39m                         \r\n                                                                                                                      \r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[39m \u001b[90mResearcher(Harpalyke) · ▸ save_memory(technique-verify-empty-tls-callback-arr…) · 159 chars\u001b[39m                         \r\n                                                                                  \r\n\u001b[97m🤖\u001b[36m\u001b[1m Researcher(Harpalyke)\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97mThe TLS memory saved; the first name was too long. Retrying with a shorter name:\u001b[39m            \u001b[22;1H\u001b[90m○\u001b[49Cprove-absence-fixed-rc4-\u001b[Ceyst\u001b[5C…running\u001b[39m \u001b[26;2H"]
